                      Vampirism Licensing Overview
                             Version 1.0

This repository contains content licensed under multiple licenses. Please review
the appropriate license file for the specific content you wish to use:

1. SOURCE CODE (CODE_LICENSE)
   All source code, including but not limited to Java files, configuration files,
   data formats, and technical documentation, is licensed under the GNU Lesser
   General Public License (LGPL) v3.0 unless otherwise noted. See licenses/CODE_LICENSE for full terms.

2. NARRATIVE CONTENT (NARRATIVE_LICENSE)
   All narrative and story content, including in-game books, letters, lore entries,
   dialogues, descriptive texts, and other authored storytelling material, is
   licensed under the Vampirism Narrative Content License (VNCL).
   See licenses/NARRATIVE_LICENSE for full terms.

3. TEXTURES AND MODELS (ASSET_LICENSE)
   All textures and models included in the mod are licensed under the Vampirism
   Asset License, which permits use for Vampirism-related content with specific
   restrictions on resource packs and commercial use.
   See licenses/ASSET_LICENSE for full terms.

4. SOUNDS
   Individual sound files are licensed under their respective licenses as noted
   in the README.md file. Each sound file's license is specified in the sound
   attribution table.

For questions about licensing or permissions, please contact the Vampirism project
maintainers or refer to the individual license files.